<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sabratek started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sabratek started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jefferies &amp; Co said it started coverage of Sabratek Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Set price target of $28 per share.</p>
<p>-- Estimates earnings per share at $0.63 in 1997, $0.85 in 1998 and $1.15 in 1999.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/4 to 24.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
